  "description": "Look-alike aircraft types, for a type the data names but the CSL library lacks (adsb.lol reports the E175 as E75L; X-CSL files it as E175). 'aliases': the same airframe under another designator, tried first. 'groups': families ordered by size; the nearest member the library has is used, the smaller one on a tie. Hand-written from the ICAO type designators (Doc 8643). The 717 (B712) has no group: its operators retired their MD-80s long ago, so a library without a 717 gives the stand to the airline's other types rather than an MD-80.",
